Read the columns as:
  raw cov    empirical coverage of mean +- 1.645*sigma_total, before any calibration
  q          the conformal multiplier that replaces 1.645
  cov(full)  coverage of that multiplier on the wells that produced it (optimistic)
  cov(LOO)   coverage when the multiplier is recomputed without the tested well (honest)
  bound      finite-sample guarantee ceil((m+1)(1-alpha))/(m+1) for the LOO calibration size
  worst      largest standardized residual, i.e. the well no ensemble anticipates

